  "releaseNotes": "10.0.19: Added implicit self-mapping (T -> T) and implicit type conversions (numeric, enum, string, nullable) for convention-mapped properties. Fixed ProjectTo coercion error for Nullable to string projections; fixed ConvertValue throwing on incompatible string-to-numeric/enum convention matches. See https://github.com/panoramicdata/PanoramicData.Mapper/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md for details.",
